   │
   ├─ r1: mumbles (l1, 0/5)
   │   ├─ malfunction 💥
   │   ├─ terminal — does not block higher levels
   │   ├─ given: .reviews/peer/1.test._.review.i001.<hash>.r001._.given.by_peer.mumbles.md
   │   └─ taken: .reviews/peer/1.test._.review.i001.<hash>.r001._.taken.by_self.mumbles.md
