🗿 route.stone.set
   ├─ stone = 1.test
   ├─ passage = malfunction
   ├─ reason = 1 of 1 reviewer malfunctioned
   ├─ still yours to clear
   │  ├─ 💥 lane mumbles (r1) broke
   │  │  └─ cause = exit code 3 (unknown)
   │  └─ next
